  Polish cinema\, screens in a new 4K restoration as part of the Wajda at 
 100 Tour. The film interweaves the fate of a nation with that of one man 
 in a small town on the final day of World War II. It is an all-time favor
 ite of Francis Ford Coppola and Martin Scorsese. The programme is organiz
